  data: {
    LLM: "If you are in the Mukankei (the team of three), you must coordinate to drain the Kankei's Joker and Ace of Trumps as early as possible. If you hold a King and your partner holds the Queen, force the Ace out.\n\nThe 'Tome-Suppe' (Spade Stop): In the final round of a match (Spades as trump), save your high spades to prevent the Kankei from achieving a 16-point sweep.\n\nCard Counting: Since there are only 50 cards and 16 points, expert players know exactly which face cards remain after the 6th trick. Use this to determine if you can afford to lose a trick to save a high card.",
